            "rdfs:comment": "This reference organ, Lung-female (https://humanatlas.io/3d-reference-library) was created using data from the Visible\nHuman Dataset, provided by the National Library of Medicine (Spitzer and Whitlock 2002). In version 1.3, the larynx,\ntrachea, and main bronchi were removed; however, lung lobes and intrapulmonary bronchi remain part of the lung model.\n\n**Bibliography:**\n\n* Spitzer, Victor M., and David G. Whitlock. 2002. “The Visible Human Dataset: The Anatomical Platform for Human Simulation.” *The Anatomical Record*  253 (2): 49–57. https://doi.org/10.1002/(SICI)1097-0185(199804)253:2<49::AID-AR8>3.0.CO;2-9.",
